/**
 * Weights for the stone reader in `stoneNet.ts`.
 *
 * Generated by `pnpm train-stones` — do not edit by hand. Stored as int8 with one scale per
 * tensor, base64 encoded.
 *
 * Trained on 14018 stones and the bare points around them, all of them drawn by
 * `pnpm patches`. Kept at the epoch that read 10502 points from the books best,
 * and reported against 4296 more from sources held out of everything. No point on a
 * real page is ever trained on.
 */
